  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Pacific Community Fisheries, Aquaculture and Marine Ecosystems Division</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program funding to the Pacific Community (SPC) Fisheries, Aquaculture and Marine Ecosystems (FAME) Division to support implementation of the SPC FAME Business Plan 2022-2027. This investment funds scientific and technical advice related to oceanic fisheries stock assessments and support for Pacific island countries and territories with coastal fisheries and aquaculture scientific advice and management.</narrative>
  </description>
